libfdt provenance
=================
The libfdt sources and public/internal headers are copied from:
https://github.com/sophgo/opensbi/tree/13b1e18dc7572ce1c85ee939260b13646874f16d/lib/utils/libfdt

The upstream files are dual licensed GPL-2.0-or-later OR BSD-2-Clause.
This integration uses their BSD-2-Clause option. Preserve each file's SPDX
and copyright notices. See LICENSE.BSD for the BSD terms; copyright
holders are identified in each retained source-file header.

libfdt_env.h is the m-ACRN adaptation: local types and small, namespaced
memory/string helpers avoid mixing the hypervisor's ABI with target libc
headers. It currently targets little-endian RV64.
